  "description": "The meme is designed for an audience that supports or aligns with conservative political viewpoints, particularly those who oppose progressive Democratic lawmakers. The target community likely includes individuals who are politically right-leaning, skeptical of the 'The Squad' as a group, and receptive to derogatory labels that frame them as disruptive or un-American. The meme leverages existing political polarization and uses the term 'the squad' as a pejorative to appeal to those who view these lawmakers as outsiders or threats to traditional political norms.",
